            <ArticleTitle>Behavioral factors in pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>749-59</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pain is reconceptualized in learning-based behavioral terms. Methods to assess behavioral elements of pain and to discuss nonmedical influences on pain with patients as well as behaviorally based tactics for early and long-term management and reactivation are discussed in this article.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
